      <dt class="font-semibold">Static assignment</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>You specify an IP address directly.</p></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Dynamic assignment</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>You specify an IP address indirectly, with namespace and pod selectors, and an optional network attachment definition.</p></dd>
